      "title": "Read this before calling it",
      "items": [
        "TEntity selects the gate; creation builds the whole model schema",
        "An existing gate table skips creation even if other tables are absent",
        "Catalog errors propagate; partial schemas can fail whole-model creation",
        "No migration history is recorded; coordinate concurrent callers"
      ]
